  "changes": [
    "SOPHIE 1.1.13 with its OS 1.54 port (irpina's soejrd/digisophie#1, merged by the author at ce17b9e), imported unchanged: glue.s and digitakt.c take every OS address from os153.inc/os153.h or os154.inc/os154.h, and the 1.54 release adds -DOS154 and defsym OS154. sophie.c and the other sources are unchanged from v1.1.13.",
    "build.json gains the 1.54 release: the author's seventeen 1.54 sites from mod.json's ports, each stock byte run turned into an address, length and SHA-256 guard as for 1.53.",
    "Modwerk serves the author's own release/digisophie-1.1.13-os1.54.elemod, pinned in sdk/imports/elekloader-digisophie-2026-10-30.json; the 1.53 package stays elekloader's pin of v1.1.13. That package records a digitakt.c hash (93052df4...) other than the committed file's (69ab5551...); glue.s and sophie.c match."
  ],
